### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/health

### Stats
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/stats

### List reasons
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/reasons

### Create ID blacklist entry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "id",
  "value": "123456",
  "reason_code": "artist",
  "reason_label": "不喜欢作者",
  "priority": 100
}

### Create keyword blacklist entry
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "keyword",
  "value": "测试关键词",
  "reason_code": "content",
  "reason_label": "题材避雷",
  "priority": 100
}

### Check batch
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"gid": "123456", "title": "任意标题"},
    {"gid": "999999", "title": "这是一个测试关键词标题"},
    {"gid": "888888", "title": "没有命中的标题"}
  ]
}

### Export
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/export
